("p", "**Earth work.** A well of diameter 7 m dug 20 m deep has soil spread evenly over a field 22 m by 14 m; volume = (22/7)(3.5)<sup>2</sup>(20) = 770 m<sup>3</sup>; height of the platform = 770/(22 x 14) = **2.5 m**."),
("p", "**Cone and cylinder.** A cone of radius r and height h is cast into a cylinder of equal radius: the height of the cylinder is h/3."),
